{
  "group": "wire-encode",
  "upstream": "socket.io-parser@4.2.7",
  "note": "Byte-for-byte comparison of the ENCODED Socket.IO packet. args[0] is {type,nsp,id,data}; binary payload values are written as {\"$bin\":\"<hex>\"}. The compared value is {frames:[...]}, where element 0 is the text frame (a JSON string) and each later element is a binary attachment frame as {\"$bin\":\"<hex>\"}. Upstream symbol: socket.io-parser Encoder.encode; Go: socketio.Encoder.Encode (which delegates to Packet.EncodeBinary/Packet.Encode).",
