      "upstreamFn": "Encoder.encode",
      "goFn": "Encoder.Encode",
      "note": "object key order in the serialised payload",
      "deviation": "Go's json.Marshal sorts object keys; JS JSON.stringify preserves insertion order. The port decodes the payload into a Go map, which cannot retain key order, so a byte-identical frame is unachievable. Semantically-equal JSON."
    },
